# Repo vs live AddOns

- **Source of truth:** `C:\Users\talla\Documents\GitHub\EZAssist` (git clone). Edit, commit, and review here only.
- **Live game folder:** `C:\Users\talla\Games\Return of Reckoning\Interface\AddOns\EZAssist` is a **runtime deploy target**, not a working tree. Do not edit live files directly; do not leave `.git` / docs / backup clutter there.
- After meaningful code changes, deploy with:

```powershell
.\tools\deploy.ps1
```

